00:03:21.139 --> 00:03:28.840
<v Hannah Price>Sorry, I can't take that one. I haven't got the capacity to give the write-up the attention it needs, especially straight away.</v>

00:03:31.289 --> 00:03:40.039
<v Priya Raman>Okay, handing that over, then. Jamie Brennan, can you write up the near miss at the forklifts by Wednesday? That one's safety critical, straight away.</v>

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:48.840
<v Jamie Brennan>Yeah, I'll take it. I'll get straight onto the near miss at the forklifts and have the write-up done by Wednesday.</v>

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:55.830
